🔹 Program 5: Binary "+" Operator Overloading

📌 Description

This program demonstrates binary operator overloading by overloading the "+" operator for a "Complex" class.

Two complex numbers are added using the expression:

"first + second"

The overloaded operator returns a new "Complex" object containing the sum.

🎯 Concept Used

Binary Operator Overloading

💡 Key Point

"first + second" is internally interpreted as:

"first.operator+(second)"
